I threw a small party at my Japanese house for my new album. It was amazing, so much love from my fam and friends! Take a look at the photo of the party in the mansion, it was so energizing!\n/memories/session-28.md:L117: Calvin: Thanks, Dave! I usually watch music videos, concerts, and documentaries about artists and their creative process. It's cool to learn more about the industry and see what others do. Plus, it's a source of inspiration for me.","content_sha256":"f8f2e2ccaa9213b12760c65a7bd494c8dd5276693468239f6dbfecc8d97c7057","coverage":[{"line_end":29,"line_start":29,"path":"/memories/session-16.md"},{"line_end":30,"line_start":30,"path":"/memories/session-16.md"},{"line_end":36,"line_start":36,"path":"/memories/session-16.md"},{"line_end":45,"line_start":45,"path":"/memories/session-16.md"},{"line_end":22,"line_start":22,"path":"/memories/session-19.md"},{"line_end":12,"line_start":12,"path":"/memories/session-28.md"},{"line_end":117,"line_start":117,"path":"/memories/session-28.md"}],"post_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","pre_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","protocol_version":"center-table12-readonly-v1","result_count":7,"result_sha256":"a63b0c2d17193e3e6ed40b71c2cb0c115f0e1768cff9c0d90485517c3ae92e7f","root_survey":false,"tool_name":"grep","truncated":false,"whole_tree_grep":true},"schema_version":2,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679"}
